### Context
This CLI project (`github.com/entireio/cli`) is adding an MCP server that exposes memory loop tools to Claude Code. The server uses `github.com/mark3labs/mcp-go` (stdio transport, already cached in module cache but not yet in go.mod — it will be added on first import).

